OL,3,GNEWSAIdeas for fun and low-cost
OL,4,Ahalf-term activities in the South
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs we enter the October half-term
OL,7,Fholiday families will be searching for
OL,8,Ffun but low-cost ideas for activities
OL,9,Fand days out.
OL,11,FAcross the south of England, many
OL,12,Fmuseums, libraries and community venues
OL,13,Foffer events aimed at children.
OL,15,FWith Autumn in full swing and Halloween
OL,16,Faround the corner, here are some ideas
OL,17,Ffrom across Dorset, Hampshire,
OL,18,FBerkshire, Oxfordshire and the Isle of
OL,19,FWight.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
